==English==
[[Image:Borage-flower-hr.jpg|thumb|''Borago officinalis'']]
===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{term|borage|lang=fro}} (compare French {{term|bourrache|lang=fr}}), from {{etyl|Medieval Latin|en}} {{term|borrago|lang=la}}, either from Latin {{term|borra||short wool, rough hair|lang=la}} or {{etyl|ar|en}} {{term|الأب من العرق||''abu min arak'', lit. father of sweat|lang=ar}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|s}}

# {{taxlink|Borago officinalis|species}}, a [[Mediterranean]] [[plant]] with [[oval]] leaves, used in [[salad]]s.

